This project is unofficial and not affiliated with or endorsed by Tesco.

Design ideas adapted from these MIT-licensed open-source projects:

- open-supermarkets (https://github.com/abracadabra50/open-supermarkets):
  the per-country grocery-provider pattern and provider-viability notes.
- tesco-grocery-mcp (https://github.com/GavinAttard/tesco-grocery-mcp):
  the batched search tool surface (multiple queries per MCP call) and
  pagination parameter shape. That project targets Tesco UK's GraphQL API;
  this project's extraction approach (SSR embedded cache on tesco.ie) is
  independent and shares no code with it.

The ireland-grocery-mcp repository carries no license and was used as a
reference for prior-art research only; no code was taken from it.
